  "description": "Tlumach.NET is a flexible library that provides translation and localization support to all kinds of .NET applications: from desktop WinForms, UWP, WPF, WinUI, and console to mobile MAUI and Avalonia to server and web applications (including MVC, Razor Pages, and Blazor).\n        This is the core package: the translation manager, the parsers of translation files, the code generator, and the localized validation attributes. The integrations with application frameworks are in separate AlliedBits.Tlumach.* packages, which depend on this one.",
